{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "orchestration/an-auto-delegating-supervisor-whose-first-pass-is-cut-short-answers-its-fallback-and-runs-no-team",
  "title": "The first pass of an auto-delegating Supervisor that its round cap cuts short hands on no task, its narration being no answer: no worker runs, its calls stay the room's, and the message is answered by the supervisor's fallback, carrying the turn's record and how it ended",
  "rules": [
    "§19.7.3",
    "§6.4"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/orchestration/test_strategy_supervisor.py test_pass_one_cut_by_its_round_cap_hands_on_no_task[narrated]; tests/orchestration/test_supervisor_pass1_cut.py test_a_cut_pass_answers_with_the_supervisors_fallback; tests/test_inbound_turns_record.py test_a_supervisor_whose_pass_was_cut_names_its_end. orchestration/strategies/supervisor/delegate.py _pass1_answer (FALLBACK_FAILED, loop_end_reason), core/mixins/_child_execution.py _handed_on.",
